Third-party numerical code
--------------------------
The xt-laipath Rust implementation includes numerical integration,
root-finding, and error-handling algorithms derived from the GNU Scientific
Library (GSL). The reviewed upstream version is GNU GSL 2.8:
https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gsl/gsl-2.8.tar.gz

Retain the upstream copyright and license notices in:
  crates/xt-laipath/NOTICE
  crates/xt-laipath/GSL-COPYRIGHTS.txt
  crates/xt-laipath/COPYING

The runtime distribution includes copies under licenses/xt-laipath/.
Other third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses and notices.
The project license does not replace those notices or the terms applicable
to NASA ATL03/ATL08 and MODIS landcover data, including cropped test fixtures.
